{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.lines\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">lines</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.Iter\">Std.Iter</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates an iterator over all lines in `s` with the line ending characters `\\r\\n` or `\\n` being\nstripped.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"foo\\r\\nbar\\n\\nbaz\\n\".toSlice.lines.toList  == [\"foo\".toSlice, \"bar\".toSlice, \"\".toSlice, \"baz\".toSlice]`\n\n* `\"foo\\r\\nbar\\n\\nbaz\".toSlice.lines.toList  == [\"foo\".toSlice, \"bar\".toSlice, \"\".toSlice, \"baz\".toSlice]`\n\n* `\"foo\\r\\nbar\\n\\nbaz\\r\".toSlice.lines.toList  == [\"foo\".toSlice, \"bar\".toSlice, \"\".toSlice, \"baz\\r\".toSlice]`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.lines","kind":"def","line":777,"name":"String.Slice.lines","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L777-L787"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.lines.lineMap\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">lines</span>.<span class=\"name\">lineMap</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.lines.lineMap","kind":"def","line":768,"name":"String.Slice.lines.lineMap","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L768-L775"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.trimAscii\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">trimAscii</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Removes leading and trailing whitespace from a slice.\n\n“Whitespace” is defined as characters for which `Char.isWhitespace` returns `true`.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"abc\".toSlice.trimAscii == \"abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"   abc\".toSlice.trimAscii == \"abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"abc \\t  \".toSlice.trimAscii == \"abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"  abc   \".toSlice.trimAscii == \"abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"abc\\ndef\\n\".toSlice.trimAscii == \"abc\\ndef\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.trimAscii","kind":"def","line":753,"name":"String.Slice.trimAscii","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L753-L766"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.revFind?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">revFind?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.Iterator\">Std.Iterator</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Control/Id.html#Id\">Id</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.SearchStep\">Pattern.SearchStep</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Consumers/Monadic/Loop.html#Std.IteratorLoop\">Std.IteratorLoop</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Control/Id.html#Id\">Id</a> <a href=\"./Init/Control/Id.html#Id\">Id</a></span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ToBackwardSearcher\">Pattern.ToBackwardSearcher</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Finds the start position of the last match of the pattern `pat` in a slice, searching\nfrom the end of the slice towards the start. If there is no match `none` is\nreturned.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns except\n`String`/`String.Slice`.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.revFind? Char.isWhitespace).map (·.get!) == some ' '`\n\n* `\"tea\".toSlice.revFind? (fun (c : Char) => c == 'X') == none`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.revFind?","kind":"def","line":734,"name":"String.Slice.revFind?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L734-L749"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.takeEndWhile\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">takeEndWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a new slice that contains the longest suffix of `s` for which `pat` matched\n\\(potentially repeatedly\\).\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.takeEndWhile Char.isLower == \"blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.takeEndWhile 'e' == \"e\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.takeEndWhile (fun (_ : Char) => true) == \"red green blue\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.takeEndWhile","kind":"def","line":719,"name":"String.Slice.takeEndWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L719-L732"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.trimAsciiEnd\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">trimAsciiEnd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Removes trailing whitespace from a slice by moving its end position to just after the last\nnon-whitespace character, or to its start position if there is no non-whitespace character.\n\n“Whitespace” is defined as characters for which `Char.isWhitespace` returns `true`.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"abc\".toSlice.trimAsciiEnd == \"abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"   abc\".toSlice.trimAsciiEnd == \"   abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"abc \\t  \".toSlice.trimAsciiEnd == \"abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"  abc   \".toSlice.trimAsciiEnd == \"  abc\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"abc\\ndef\\n\".toSlice.trimAsciiEnd == \"abc\\ndef\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.trimAsciiEnd","kind":"def","line":701,"name":"String.Slice.trimAsciiEnd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L701-L717"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropEndWhile\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">dropEndWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a new slice by removing the longest suffix from `s` for which `pat` matched\n\\(potentially repeatedly\\).\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropEndWhile Char.isLower == \"red green \".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropEndWhile 'e' == \"red green blu\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropEndWhile (fun (_ : Char) => true) == \"\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropEndWhile","kind":"def","line":688,"name":"String.Slice.dropEndWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L688-L699"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.revAll\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">revAll</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Checks whether a slice only consists of matches of the pattern `pat`, starting from the back\nof the string.\n\nShort-circuits at the first pattern mis-match.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nFor many types of patterns, this function can be expected to return the same result as\n`Slice.all`. If mismatches are expected to occur close to the end of the string, this function\nmight be more efficient.\n\nFor some types of patterns, this function will return a different result than `Slice.all`.\nConsider, for example, a pattern that matches the longest string at the given position that matches\nthe regular expression `\"a|aa|ab\"`. Then, given the input string `\"aab\"`, performing\n`Slice.all` will greedily match the prefix `\"aa\"` and then get stuck on the remainder\n`\"b\"`, causing it to return `false`. On the other hand, `Slice.revAll` will match\nthe suffix `\"ab\"` and then match the remainder `\"a\"`, so it will return `true`.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"brown\".toSlice.revAll Char.isLower = true`\n\n* `\"brown and orange\".toSlice.revAll Char.isLower = false`\n\n* `\"aaaaaa\".toSlice.revAll 'a' = true`\n\n* `\"aaaaaa\".toSlice.revAll \"aa\" = true`\n\n* `\"aaaaaaa\".toSlice.revAll \"aa\" = false`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.revAll","kind":"def","line":658,"name":"String.Slice.revAll","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L658-L686"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.skipSuffixWhile\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">skipSuffixWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the position at the start of the longest suffix of `s` for which `pat` matches\n\\(potentially repeatedly\\).\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.skipSuffixWhile","kind":"def","line":650,"name":"String.Slice.skipSuffixWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L650-L656"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.Pos.revSkipWhile\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">Pos</span>.<span class=\"name\">revSkipWhile</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pos</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Rewinds `pos` as long as `pat` matches.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.Pos.revSkipWhile","kind":"def","line":636,"name":"String.Slice.Pos.revSkipWhile","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L636-L648"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropSuffix\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">dropSuffix</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a suffix of `s`, returns the remainder. Returns `s` unmodified\notherwise.\n\nUse `String.Slice.dropSuffix?` to return `none` when `pat` does not match a\nsuffix.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix \" blue\" == \"red green\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix \"bluu \" == \"red green blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix 'e' == \"red green blu\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix Char.isLower == \"red green blu\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropSuffix","kind":"def","line":617,"name":"String.Slice.dropSuffix","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L617-L634"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropSuffix?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">dropSuffix?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a suffix of `s`, returns the remainder. Returns `none` otherwise.\n\nUse `String.Slice.dropSuffix` to return the slice\nunchanged when `pat` does not match a suffix.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix? \" blue\" == some \"red green\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix? \"bluu \" == none`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix? 'e' == some \"red green blu\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropSuffix? Char.isLower == some \"red green blu\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropSuffix?","kind":"def","line":599,"name":"String.Slice.dropSuffix?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L599-L615"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.Pos.revSkip?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">Pos</span>.<span class=\"name\">revSkip?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pos</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a suffix at `pos`, returns the position at the beginning of the match.\nReturns `none` otherwise.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.Pos.revSkip?","kind":"def","line":589,"name":"String.Slice.Pos.revSkip?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L589-L597"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.skipSuffix?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">skipSuffix?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.BackwardPattern\">Pattern.BackwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a suffix of `s`, returns the position at the beginning of the suffix.\nReturns `none` otherwise.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.skipSuffix?","kind":"def","line":579,"name":"String.Slice.skipSuffix?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L579-L587"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.revSplit\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">revSplit</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ToBackwardSearcher\">Pattern.ToBackwardSearcher</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.Iter\">Std.Iter</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Splits a slice at each subslice that matches the pattern `pat`, starting from the end of the\nslice and traversing towards the start.\n\nThe subslices that matched the pattern are not included in any of the resulting subslices. If\nmultiple subslices in a row match the pattern, the resulting list will contain empty slices.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns except\n`String`/`String.Slice`.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.revSplit Char.isWhitespace).toList == [\"water\".toSlice, \"tea\".toSlice, \"coffee\".toSlice]`\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.revSplit ' ').toList == [\"water\".toSlice, \"tea\".toSlice, \"coffee\".toSlice]`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.revSplit","kind":"def","line":560,"name":"String.Slice.revSplit","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L560-L577"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.RevSplitIterator.instIteratorLoopOfMonad\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">RevSplitIterator</span>.<span class=\"name\">instIteratorLoopOfMonad</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ✝</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ✝</span>}</span></span> </span><span cl