ass=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/ToSlice.html#String.ToSlice\">ToSlice</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pattern</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ToForwardSearcher\">Pattern.ToForwardSearcher</a> <span class=\"fn\">pattern</span> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">replacement</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Constructs a new string obtained by replacing all occurrences of `pattern` with\n`replacement` in `s`.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns. The replacement may be a\n`String` or a `String.Slice`.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.replace 'e' \"\" = \"rd grn blu\"`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.replace (fun c => c == 'u' || c == 'e') \"\" = \"rd grn bl\"`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.replace \"e\" \"\" = \"rd grn blu\"`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.replace \"ee\" \"E\" = \"red grEn blue\"`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.replace \"e\" \"E\" = \"rEd grEEn bluE\"`\n\n* `\"aaaaa\".toSlice.replace \"aa\" \"b\" = \"bba\"`\n\n* `\"abc\".toSlice.replace \"\" \"k\" = \"kakbkck\"`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.replace","kind":"def","line":305,"name":"String.Slice.replace","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L305-L325"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropPrefix\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">dropPrefix</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ForwardPattern\">Pattern.ForwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a prefix of `s`, returns the remainder. Returns `s` unmodified\notherwise.\n\nUse `String.Slice.dropPrefix?` to return `none` when `pat` does not match a prefix.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix \"red \" == \"green blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix \"reed \" == \"red green blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix 'r' == \"ed green blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix Char.isLower == \"ed green blue\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropPrefix","kind":"def","line":287,"name":"String.Slice.dropPrefix","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L287-L303"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropPrefix?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">dropPrefix?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ForwardPattern\">Pattern.ForwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a prefix of `s`, returns the remainder. Returns `none` otherwise.\n\nUse `String.Slice.dropPrefix` to return the slice\nunchanged when `pat` does not match a prefix.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix? \"red \" == some \"green blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix? \"reed \" == none`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix? 'r' == some \"ed green blue\".toSlice`\n\n* `\"red green blue\".toSlice.dropPrefix? Char.isLower == some \"ed green blue\".toSlice`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.dropPrefix?","kind":"def","line":269,"name":"String.Slice.dropPrefix?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L269-L285"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.Pos.skip?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">Pos</span>.<span class=\"name\">skip?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pos</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ForwardPattern\">Pattern.ForwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a prefix at `pos`, returns the position after the end of the match.\nReturns `none` otherwise.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.Pos.skip?","kind":"def","line":259,"name":"String.Slice.Pos.skip?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L259-L267"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.skipPrefix?\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">skipPrefix?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ForwardPattern\">Pattern.ForwardPattern</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `pat` matches a prefix of `s`, returns the position at the start of the remainder.\nReturns `none` otherwise.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.skipPrefix?","kind":"def","line":249,"name":"String.Slice.skipPrefix?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L249-L257"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.splitInclusive\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">splitInclusive</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pat</span> : <span class=\"fn\">ρ</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.ToForwardSearcher\">Pattern.ToForwardSearcher</a> <span class=\"fn\">pat</span> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.Iter\">Std.Iter</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Splits a slice at each subslice that matches the pattern `pat`. Unlike `split` the\nmatched subslices are included at the end of each subslice.\n\nThis function is generic over all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.splitInclusive Char.isWhitespace).toList == [\"coffee \".toSlice, \"tea \".toSlice, \"water\".toSlice]`\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.splitInclusive ' ').toList == [\"coffee \".toSlice, \"tea \".toSlice, \"water\".toSlice]`\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.splitInclusive \" tea \").toList == [\"coffee tea \".toSlice, \"water\".toSlice]`\n\n* `(\"baaab\".toSlice.splitInclusive \"aa\").toList == [\"baa\".toSlice, \"ab\".toSlice]`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.splitInclusive","kind":"def","line":232,"name":"String.Slice.splitInclusive","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L232-L247"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.SplitInclusiveIterator.instIteratorLoopIdOfMonad\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">SplitInclusiveIterator</span>.<span class=\"name\">instIteratorLoopIdOfMonad</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.Iterator\">Std.Iterator</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Control/Id.html#Id\">Id</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Pattern/Basic.html#String.Slice.Pattern.SearchStep\">Pattern.SearchStep</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)