er all currently supported patterns.\n\nExamples:\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.splitToSubslice Char.isWhitespace).toStringList == [\"coffee\", \"tea\", \"water\"]`\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.splitToSubslice ' ').toStringList == [\"coffee\", \"tea\", \"water\"]`\n\n* `(\"coffee tea water\".toSlice.splitToSubslice \" tea \").toStringList == [\"coffee\", \"water\"]`\n\n* `(\"ababababa\".toSlice.splitToSubslice \"aba\").toStringList == [\"\", \"b\", \"ba\"]`\n\n* `(\"baaab\".toSlice.splitToSubslice \"aa\").toStringList == [\"b\", \"ab\"]`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.splitToSubslice","kind":"def","line":120,"name":"String.Slice.splitToSubslice","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.lean#L120-L138"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/String/Slice/Pattern.html#String.Slice.SplitIterator.instIteratorLoopIdSubsliceOfMonad\"><span class=\"name\">String</span>.<span class=\"name\">Slice</span>.<span class=\"name\">SplitIterator</span>.<span class=\"name\">instIteratorLoopIdSubsliceOfMonad</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">ρ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a> → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></span>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">Slice</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Iterators/Basic.html#Std.Iterator\">Std.Iterator</a> <span class=